<<if equipped() == 0 || equipped() == 1>>
You don't look like a miner... where's your protective equipment?
-> I'm Pseudo Mu
  Well aren't you fancy, what could you be doing down here? If your looking for the main Cu prime mine, you need to go to floor 33, not floor 32.
    -> I'm here about the accident
      Aw... another detective. Lawrence was always so friendly to me. To see him like that, was just heart breaking.
      You know we looked for him for almost two days straight? Alfus kept telling me we we needed to go back and rest but Filmont and I...
      How could we even sleep, feet away from that empty cot?
      The last one said we couldn't move the body until the investigation finished, so the door to the mine has been barred up since.
      -> Have you seen Breacher
        I believe he came through, has anyone ever told you, you look quite similar to each other?
        He made such a scene, throwing tape everywhere, blocking off the mines. I wish we could just get on with this, it's terrible I can't even mourn properly.
        Earlier this morning was the last time I saw him. He was pouring over some map of the mine I believe. Let me know if theres anything else I can help with.
        <<set $metSil to 1>>
    -> I'm here for Breacher
      I believe he came through, has anyone ever told you, you look quite similar to each other?
      He made such a scene, throwing tape everywhere, blocking off the mines. I wish we could just get on with this, it's terrible I can't even mourn properly.
      Earlier this morning was the last time I saw him. He was pouring over some map of the mine I believe. Let me know if theres anything else I can help with.
      <<set $metSil to 1>>
-> I'm new here
  Well you can't be walking around here like that. Talk to Alfus, that feather-head over there for help.
<<endif>>

<<if equipped() == 2>>
Excuse me! you can't be down here without equipment... you wouldn't want to ruin those fancy clothes right?
-> I'm Pseudo Mu
  What a strange name, you must be foreign. Is this your first time in the dungeon? I could certainly show you the ropes.
    -> I'm here about the accident
      The accident? Oh I wish this would be over with already. I've been crying every night, hoping it would just go away.
      We were so hopeful, praying, even though I don't believe in that sort of thing. To find Lawrence like that was terrible.
      You understand right? You seem like you know about this sort of thing, work squabbles, workplace accidents... 
      I think we just need to help with the investigation, and it will disappear... before my heart gives out...
      -> Have you seen Breacher
        Oh that old salty dog? He's always kicking around my stones, you know I had them sorted by worth! And then there they go along the ground...
        I'm sure he's around somewhere, off exploring the caves to the east no doubt. He's always going where he shouldnt... or should(?) be....
        But *you* shouldn't go there at all. Its unstable and I'd hate to lose someone like you so soon after meeting.
        Feel free to ask me anything else new friend!
        <<set $metSil to 1>>
    -> I'm here for Breacher
      Oh that old salty dog? He's always kicking around my stones, you know I had them sorted by worth! And then there they go along the ground...
      I'm sure he's around somewhere, off exploring the caves to the east no doubt.
      But you shouldn't go there at all. Its unstable and I'd hate to lose someone like you so soon after meeting.
      Feel free to ask me anything else new friend!
      <<set $metSil to 1>>
-> I'm new here
  Alfus... can probably get you situated. Looking forward to working with you!
<<endif>>
