__PrivCrochet_colorID: 0
__PrivCrochet_position: 1291,409
__PrivCrochet_tags: 
title: SilMet
---
<<if equipped() == 0 || equipped() == 1>>
Nice to see you again!
-> About the western mine
  You should be quite careful. There are holes all over from drilling, and we don't necessarily have the equipment to get you out if you fall in.
  The mine is dark and there is no formal map for it yet. It may be easy to get lost.
  We're... already in this situation... please don't make it worse.
-> About the eastern mine
  I'm sorry but I don't know much. At one point it was illuminated well, but a power surge or other issue destroyed our energy network some months ago.
  I believe Alfus is working on a fix, but in the meantime, stay in here with us.
-> About Breacher
  Have you found him yet? It can't have been that long since he wondered off.
  I was dispatched because he failed to make his daily report. Twice. #PSEUDO MU
  That long? I know we don't have the sun but it feels wrong... you're starting to worry me with all these questions...
-> About Lawrence
  Have you found out anything? Can't you talk to your mission control, and get a team down here? Having his body surrounded my tape, It's just terrible.
  We deserve to send him off right.
<<endif>>

<<if equipped() == 2>>
It's so great to see you again! Are you glowing or something? I feel like you're brighter...
-> About the western mine
  My old injury slows me down a lot, but I know the place like the back of my hand. You do not want to be in there, trust me.
  There are huge holes all over the floor, loose walls, and a cave in wouldn't surprise me at all.
  You should just stay out here with me and the rest of the crew. We get along so well, I couldn't stand any other accidents happening.
-> About the eastern mine
  At one point it was illuminated well, but a power surge or other issue destroyed our energy network some months ago.
  Alfus keeps telling us not to go in there. I know hes working on something, I just can't exactly remember what it is. 
  I trust him though, he's really a good leader, I'm sure you'll warm up to him quickly.
-> About Breacher
  Have you found him yet? I hope i've been helpful to you.
  I have not found him. #PSEUDO MU
  Really? Time seems to pass so quickly... you're starting to worry me with all these questions...
-> About Lawrence
  I feel terrible about it. Accidents, you know, a lot of the time they're not really accidents, its just someone wont listen.
  They feel they need to prove something or other, I don't know maybe people just like to fly too close to the sun.
  -> What do you mean?
    I mean... what I mean is... It's just hard to believe Lawrence is gone... I'm still struggling with it.
    That's all I mean.
<<endif>>
===
